  sitQA: [['What is the problem in the situation?', 'Students do not know what the inside of the Earth is like.'], ['Is the inside of the Earth empty?', 'No. It is made of solid and liquid layers.'], ['How do scientists know this?', 'They study earthquake waves that pass through the Earth.']],
  justification: 'This lesson helps us to understand the structure of the Earth and the forces that build and wear down the landscape.',
