  evaluation: [['Define mass wasting.', 'The downslope movement of soil and rock under gravity.'], ['Give two factors of mass wasting.', 'Heavy rain and steep slopes (also deforestation).']],
  remediation: ['The force that causes mass wasting is ______.', 'Leaning posts show slow soil ______.', 'A very fast, dry fall of rocks is a ______.'],
