  competence: 'Learners are able to explain how rivers erode, carry and deposit material.',
  objectives: ['Explain the processes of river erosion.', 'Describe how rivers carry their load.', 'Interpret the Hjulström graph and describe the river as a system.'],
  recall: ['Denudation includes erosion, transport and deposition.', 'Running water is the main agent of erosion.'],
